WEBVTT

00:19:28.332 --> 00:19:30.592
Did you see any of those sharper edges?

00:19:31.503 --> 00:19:33.213
DF: Yeah, I think that feels right,

00:19:33.237 --> 00:19:35.689
you know, from having lived
inside a strong culture,

00:19:35.713 --> 00:19:41.859
is that some things start
to just happen because.

00:19:42.215 --> 00:19:44.918
I'm not sure if you're familiar
with the pot roast story,

00:19:44.942 --> 00:19:47.560
but it's one of these
work-fables of just doing things.

00:19:47.584 --> 00:19:49.767
AG: The what?
DF: The pot roast story?

00:19:50.099 --> 00:19:52.003
AG: Not described that way.

00:19:52.027 --> 00:19:53.606
DF: OK, I'll give it real quick,

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.265
it's a parent and a child
cooking a pot roast,

00:19:56.289 --> 00:19:59.530
and the first thing the parent does
when they take the pot roast out

00:19:59.554 --> 00:20:00.752
is they cut the ends off.